{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"file_impact":[{"path":"adapters/interfaces/git_host.py","reason":"replace CommitRequest.files with workspace and tree"},{"path":"adapters/real/git_host.py","reason":"commit and push from the workspace, drop the temporary clone and the execution_id trailer search, replay on a tree comparison against the remote head"},{"path":"adapters/real/local_git_host.py","reason":"commit from the workspace and update the local branch, drop the worktree and trailer search"},{"path":"adapters/mock/git_host.py","reason":"record the published tree per branch and replay on an unchanged tree, drop the execution-keyed applied set"},{"path":"services/orchestration/materialization.py","reason":"add staging returning the tree hash and whether it differs from the head, carry workspace and tree on the commit request, replace collect_changes with changed_paths"},{"path":"services/orchestration/temporal_activities/repair.py","reason":"derive changed_files and applied from changed_paths so a deletion is reported"},{"path":"services/orchestration/temporal_activities/implementation.py","reason":"derive changed files from changed_paths so a deletion is reported"},{"path":"services/integration/github/mediator.py","reason":"target the github.commit SideEffectRef on the published tree"},{"path":"services/orchestration/temporal_activities/pull_request.py","reason":"stage before committing and verify the remote head and a clean workspace after pushing, logging both heads on divergence"},{"path":"services/orchestration/bounded_task_pipeline.py","reason":"decide the no-changes outcome from the staging result rather than an empty file mapping"},{"path":"docs/change-publication.md","reason":"new doc recording that the checked tree is the published tree and the verification enforcing it"},{"path":"tests/unit/test_commit_publish.py","reason":"new tests for publish fidelity, the repair loop, tree replay and the post-push verification"},{